{"unit_id":"fan56__dsh-profile-switch#feature-1","repo":"fan56/dsh-profile-switch","commit":"e6176b8583c2ab0c60f39ee83ba53f7bf3742bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Profile Switch 的功能「工作区切换」：选择已保存配置，为当前目录绑定模型方案，并在可用时更新当前会话。通过 `/profile-switch` 触发，结果写入工作区 pin。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/flows.ts:413-483"]}
{"unit_id":"fan56__dsh-profile-switch#feature-2","repo":"fan56/dsh-profile-switch","commit":"e6176b8583c2ab0c60f39ee83ba53f7bf3742bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Profile Switch 的功能「配置向导」：交互式创建或编辑模型配置，按 provider、model、思考级别逐步选择；也可重命名或删除配置。通过 `/profile-cfg` 进入。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/flows.ts:496-563","src/flows.ts:620-657"]}
{"unit_id":"fan56__dsh-profile-switch#feature-3","repo":"fan56/dsh-profile-switch","commit":"e6176b8583c2ab0c60f39ee83ba53f7bf3742bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Profile Switch 的功能「保存当前选择」：将当前模型路由保存为新配置，并可选择记录发现的 agent 基线。用户在 `/profile-cfg` 选择 save-current 后完成问答。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/flows.ts:590-617"]}
{"unit_id":"fan56__dsh-profile-switch#feature-4","repo":"fan56/dsh-profile-switch","commit":"e6176b8583c2ab0c60f39ee83ba53f7bf3742bc5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Profile Switch 的功能「子 agent 覆盖」：检测到 registry 后，可选择 agent 并设置模型与思考级别；跳过或选择继承时保留基线行为。通过配置向导触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/flows.ts:315-347","src/flows.ts:573-588"]}
